@@ -1,2 +1,5 @@
+---
 bugfixes:
   - uri - properly use uri parameter use_proxy (https://github.com/ansible/ansible/issues/58632)
+general:
+  - uri - add ``use_netrc`` parameter to control whether ``.netrc`` is used for credentials (default: yes). This allows users to prevent ``.netrc`` from overriding manually specified ``Authorization`` headers.
